{"unit_id":"tag:041O:proof","translation":"我们使用引理<REF_0001>证明此结论。该引理的假设(1)和(2)由空间的态射（Morphisms），引理<REF_0002>得到。设<MATH_0001>为<MATH_0002>上的仿射概形（affine schemes）的满射（surjective）平坦（flat）态射（morphism）。设<MATH_0003>为代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism），并假设基变换（base change）<MATH_0004>普遍闭（universally closed）。我们要证明<MATH_0005>普遍闭（universally closed）。为此，再次使用空间的态射（Morphisms），引理<REF_0003>，只需证明对于每个仿射概形（affine scheme）<MATH_0006>和态射（morphism）<MATH_0007>，映射（map）<MATH_0008>是闭的（closed）。考虑立方图(<REF_0004>)。<MATH_0009>普遍闭（universally closed）的假设推出<MATH_0010>是闭的（closed）。由于<MATH_0011>拟紧（quasi-compact）、满射（surjective）且平坦（flat），作为<MATH_0012>的基变换（base change），可知映射（map）<MATH_0013>是商映射（submersive），见态射（Morphisms），引理<REF_0005>。此外，映射（map）<MATH_0014>是满射的（surjective），见空间的性质，引理<REF_0006>。由初等拓扑（topology）可得<MATH_0015>是闭的（closed）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"空间的态射"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"universally closed","target_term":"普遍闭"},{"source_term":"universally closed","target_term":"普遍闭"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"空间的态射"},{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"closed","target_term":"闭的"},{"source_term":"universally closed","target_term":"普遍闭"},{"source_term":"closed","target_term":"闭的"},{"source_term":"quasi-compact","target_term":"拟紧"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"submersive","target_term":"商映射"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_ter